      "sourceTextSha256": "a1ab7044b5bb9e22aeb2a9915c85f0e6aeef4b46dd81f9ab9bd2c62f8964bafe",
      "text": "Arrive at Bogotá International Airport, where you’ll be met and taken to your hotel for check-in.\n\nThe Spanish founded Bogotá in the 16th century on the site of Indigenous settlements. The city’s name is thought to be linked to a Chibcha chief. Today it’s a major city with historic districts, museums, restaurants, cafés and modern visitor areas.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-1ec1641096b2",
        "model": "GPT-6 Codex"
      }
